                    "value": "<p>The bloodspawned hound is drawn to the blood of other creatures. All creatures within 30 feet that are taking persistent bleed damage are dealt @Damage[1d4[void]] damage. The bloodspawned hound then teleports to an unoccupied space adjacent to a creature damaged this way.</p>"
